  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">MEET THE ARTIST</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-websitemanager post-6748 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-meet-the-artist tag-vivien-oswells-bench\" id=\"post-6748\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/viviens-bench/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-equal thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"1025\" height=\"485\" alt=\"Group of people around a bench with painting.\" src=\"/media/archive/6d458e30b9d9b042227afff3c61498071e4f59167a22cb87f4454ebf06af67f1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/viviens-bench/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Vivien’s Bench</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2024-03-26T15:11:14-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, March 26, 2024, 3:11 pm\">March 26, 2024</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>On a recent sunny Saturday members of the Guild of Harwich Artists gathered in Doane Park in Harwich Port to celebrate  (age 100), a co-founding member of the Guild.  The <a href=\"/news/viviens-bench/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5752 post type-post status-publish format-video has-post-thumbnail category-meet-the-artist category-news category-zoom tag-larry-folding tag-monthly-meetings tag-zoom\" id=\"post-5752\">\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/larry-folding-demo/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Larry Folding Demo</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/archive/source-dfd2582e14930d4b2c34/\" class=\"post-format-link\">Video</a>\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-05-01T07:57:38-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, May 1, 2021, 7:57 am\">May 1, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5734\" src=\"/media/archive/9b6b9a0f8c5f6130988f7ec84e1e2c687ecfcbed898826363f24ba86889e0585.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"188\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Larry Folding gave a tour of his Harwich studio and a 1/2 hour watercolor demonstration at the April 24th General Meeting. View the meeting here using the access passcode <b>LarryFolding@421<br />\n</b></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Meeting Recording:<b><br />\n<a href=\"https://us02web.zoom.us/rec/share/MiczSnz4GPEXuG6fyfaaXQLi-1k5n0SO8FmNMrGcEQT5JULPAiJfJasLnFHxILhK.GRF-deVAvkf0L3Ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://us02web.zoom.us/rec/<wbr></wbr>share/<wbr></wbr>MiczSnz4GPEXuG6fyfaaXQLi-<wbr></wbr>1k5n0SO8FmNMrGcEQT5JULPAiJfJas<wbr></wbr>LnFHxILhK.GRF-deVAvkf0L3Ca</a></b></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5197 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news\" id=\"post-5197\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/the-art-gallery-opens-june-27/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"578\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of trees\" src=\"/media/archive/39a644a35a6c433539cf27b17d1f13de669dcbb0044f1c9ca7637945fc294849.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/the-art-gallery-opens-june-27/\" rel=\"bookmark\">The Art Gallery Opens Mid-April 2024</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2020-06-15T11:44:48-04:00\" title=\"Monday, June 15, 2020, 11:44 am\">June 15, 2020</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Art Gallery opens for the 2024 season in Mid-April with the works of 24 artists who live and paint on Cape Cod. Ours is a postcard life in art, <a href=\"/news/the-art-gallery-opens-june-27/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4850 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-bank-shows category-events category-meet-the-artist category-monthly-meetings category-ornament-fundraiser category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news\" id=\"post-4850\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guild-news-december-2019/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"330\" height=\"242\" alt=\"A red and white logo.\" src=\"/media/archive/d628430c893acef788bc2bbe74472c5859c7875a114ebdc857cc9102d0377062.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-news-december-2019/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild News December 2019</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-11-27T14:16:00-05:00\" title=\"Wednesday, November 27, 2019, 2:16 pm\">November 27, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Compiled by Joan Carroll The General Meeting will take place on January 25, 2020, not January 18, due to the Martin Luther King Holiday, from 2:00-4:00 p.m. Michael Rudden encourages <a href=\"/news/guild-news-december-2019/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4781 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-meet-the-artist tag-sedona-summer tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-4781\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-sedona-summer/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Sedona summer coloring page.\" src=\"/media/archive/d15f63b1db2d25e8f070bb1c3614de447c80f0b6d2a9dd4e9f65a553e8044619.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-sedona-summer/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meet The Artist Sedona Summer</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-11-19T20:02:36-05:00\" title=\"Tuesday, November 19, 2019, 8:02 pm\">November 19, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Sedona Summer will be featuring her children’s book, Spunky Sherry Sprite, the girl that loved to dance, at a Meet The Artist on December 7, 2019 from 1:00-4:00 p.m. at the Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4678 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news\" id=\"post-4678\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/4678-2/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"553\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A woman smiling at the camera.\" src=\"/media/archive/d39ea77525f853a8a022b39667cec44ede20df6b1816d0c7e0117b464b60df08.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/4678-2/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Gallery Reception for   Vivien Oswell</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-08-20T12:18:19-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, August 20, 2019, 12:18 pm\">August 20, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Hosted by Cape Cod Community Media Center 17 Shad Hole Rd, Dennis Port, MA 02639 Thursday, September 19, 2019, at 4 PM – 6 PM</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav class=\"navigation pagination\" aria-label=\"Posts pagination\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Posts pagination</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"nav-links\"><span class=\"page-numbers current\">1</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>2</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<span class=\"page-numbers dots\">…</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Arc